            "notes": "*I threw a shield in the well,\ndon't ask me,\nI'll never tell*\n\nWe're still pretty early into the build, so it's hard to know how much cash you'll have. If you can afford the optional blues, get them and fill the rest with whatever greens for survival and ability power you can.\n\nNow is also, however, the time to admit if you're dying too much. If you are dead, you're not doing damage. Instead of focusing on AP, get Vishkar instead. You are no use to your team in spawn. This round involves a lot of thinking what you're doing well and what you're not. So take your sprinkle of blues and greens listed as you can. If you have odd cash left over, try to do anything that increases your AP or survival.",
