            "notes": "*Hot night, wind gust blowin'\nWhere you think you're goin', baby?*\n\nI can't figure out how to make Wind Gust the main power here if you chose Seismic, but I'd go with Wind Gust if I didn't grab it. But being round 7, you can really choose whatever fits your playstyle best. A lot of people really like Deep Pockets after the buff. I enjoy Volley if I'm against a Winston specifically because the spread will still hit his bubble.",
